Main thread, concurrently, in the steps (OptionsDialog::ApplyVideoSettings -> SunLight::ExtRequestMaxShadowResSync -> ExtSyncMaxShadowRes(true), sunlight.cpp:336-345):
  _depthTarget->_width = want;
